# Intercepted provider response, real bounded scope executor and immutable review.
name: One approved AI scope proposal retains context, coverage and shared spending
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_model.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/alpha-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | imported-map
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | accepted-map
keys: Escape
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks secret-scan
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 ACCEPTED SCOPES | inventory-first
keys: Enter Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 AI SCOPE PRIORITIES | optional-proposal
paste-file: @ART/priorities.txt
live-snap: multiline-priorities
expect: loose parent files
ask: Does the optional action preserve multiline priorities and make clear that model and spending review come before any request?
keys: F2
require-live-snap: 20 SUGGEST SCAN SCOPES | proposal-form
expect: One scope proposal job
expect: exact accepted Map revision
keys: M
require-live-snap: 20 MODEL | model-picker
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 SUGGEST SCAN SCOPES | model-origin-restored
ask: Does canceling model selection restore the exact scope proposal draft, priorities and budget origin without replacing context or starting work?
keys: t
type: 8
keys: Enter
keys: r
type: 2
keys: Enter
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | fixed-scope-job
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_model.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
resize: 160x48
live-snap: proposal-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: proposal-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: proposal-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: proposal-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: proposal-40x12
expect: PgUp/Dn
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 15 consumed attempts remain recorded. | proposal-small-last
ask: At 40x12, can the operator read all scope, model, spending and regeneration terms while keeping visible controls and the same finite job?
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | scope-approval
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 y approve | approval-last
expect: 1 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 8
ask: Does approval disclose one fixed model job, eight shared calls, two protected review calls, retained commitments and uncertain dollars without authorizing scans or recursive work?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Open approved scope proposal job | approved-proposal
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 L starts the approved jobs | proposal-before-launch
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | proposal-started
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_model.py @TMP_TARGET @ART finished
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 1 job(s) · 1 completed | proposal-completed
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 Review suggested scopes | saved-proposal-result
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 DRAFT SCOPES | suggested-boundaries
expect: Labeled code boundary
ask: Does the actual scope executor produce unaccepted boundaries with coverage and model-input limitations, while retaining the operator's exclusion and globally active context?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Accept boundaries | boundary-approval
keys: Enter Down Down Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 30 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted-boundaries
keys: p
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | inherited-study
expect: 1 committed / 8 total
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | separate-scan-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_model.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scan-draft
ask: Does the next three-pass study retain the scope proposal's spending and require its own approval, with no discovery started?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 1 job(s) · 1 completed | saved-proposal-campaign
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 Review suggested scopes | result-after-restart
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_model.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: After actual exit and no-color restart, can the exact completed proposal and shared accounting be read without rerunning the model or scanning source?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
